From: hans2294 <22217531+hans2294@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 03:21:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] haiku: libGL with BGLView on EGL

A libGL.so.1 for Haiku's GL kit: BGLView renders into an EGL pbuffer
(surfaceless platform) and SwapBuffers reads it back into a BBitmap that
the view draws. The GL entry points come from libglapi_bridge, so
existing BGLView programs run on any gallium driver EGL can open.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
